# Regenerated by Symfony on every cache warm-up, and not deterministically:
# the order of two keys inside one @psalm-type block flips between runs, so a
# tracked copy shows a phantom two-line diff after any command that boots the
# kernel. Its own header says it is auto-generated and for apps only — it is a
# build artefact that exists to help an IDE, not source.
/config/reference.php
/public/bundles/
/var/
/vendor/
